{"seq":3,"slug":"wavetable-granular","title":"波表合成与粒子合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/synthesis-methods/wavetable-granular","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"波表合成与粒子合成\">波表合成与粒子合成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>波表合成与粒子合成代表了两种超越&quot;固定波形 + 滤波&quot;的现代思路，它们分别从频谱的&quot;帧&quot;和时间的&quot;颗粒&quot;入手：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>波表合成 = 多帧单周期波形</strong>：一个波表包含多帧波形，通过 Position 参数在帧间插值，实现频谱随时间平滑演变。</li>\n<li><strong>扫描是表现力核心</strong>：用 LFO、包络或 MIDI 控制器驱动 Position，让静态波形变成&quot;频谱动画&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>抗混叠是技术关键</strong>：高音回放时高次谐波超过 Nyquist 会折返，需依赖多重采样率波表或 PolyBLEP 等方法。</li>\n<li><strong>粒子合成 = 声音的原子化重组</strong>：把声音切成 1–100 ms 的颗粒再重新组合，从而解耦时间与频率。</li>\n<li><strong>两种方法互补</strong>：波表擅长频谱演化，粒子擅长时间拉伸与纹理，选择取决于目标音色。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"波表合成的基本原理\">波表合成的基本原理</h2><p>波表合成（Wavetable Synthesis）使用预存的单周期波形表（Wavetable）作为振荡器的波形来源。一个波表包含多帧（Frame）不同的单周期波形，合成器可以在帧之间插值过渡，创造频谱随时间平滑变化的效果——这是纯减法合成难以实现的。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Interp</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = \\text{Interp}\\left(W[p(t)], f_0, t\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Interp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为波表数组，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(t) \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 为波表位置（Wavetable Position），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为回放频率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波表参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>音色效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Position</td>\n<td>当前帧位置</td>\n<td>0–1 (或 0–255)</td>\n<td>频谱形态选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frame Count</td>\n<td>波表总帧数</td>\n<td>2–256</td>\n<td>变化丰富度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sample Length</td>\n<td>每帧采样数</td>\n<td>256–2048</td>\n<td>频率分辨率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interpolation</td>\n<td>帧间插值方式</td>\n<td>线性/样条</td>\n<td>过渡平滑度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>波表来源的多样性是其灵活性的关键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>适合音色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数学生成</td>\n<td>加法合成公式</td>\n<td>精确可控</td>\n<td>经典数字音色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频导入</td>\n<td>采样 FFT 切片</td>\n<td>真实感</td>\n<td>有机纹理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绘制</td>\n<td>手绘波形</td>\n<td>独特</td>\n<td>实验音色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变形</td>\n<td>波形间 Morphing</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>演化 Pad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spectral</td>\n<td>频谱编辑</td>\n<td>精细</td>\n<td>泛音设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;波表&lt;br/&gt;256 帧&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Position 控制&lt;br/&gt;选择当前帧&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;帧间插值&lt;br/&gt;平滑过渡&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;频率适配&lt;br/&gt;音高回放&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;输出波形&quot;]&#10;    F[&quot;LFO/Env&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;调制 Position&quot;| B\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"波表&lt;br/&gt;256 帧\"] --&gt; B[\"Position 控制&lt;br/&gt;选择当前帧\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"帧间插值&lt;br/&gt;平滑过渡\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"频率适配&lt;br/&gt;音高回放\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"输出波形\"]\n    F[\"LFO/Env\"] --&gt;|\"调制 Position\"| B</pre><h2 id=\"波表扫描与频谱动画\">波表扫描与频谱动画</h2><p>波表合成的表现力核心在于&quot;扫描&quot;——用调制源（LFO、包络、MIDI 控制器）驱动 Wavetable Position 随时间变化，使频谱如动画般演化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>LFO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Env</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(t) = p_0 + \\text{LFO}(t) \\cdot D_{lfo} + \\text{Env}(t) \\cdot D_{env}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFO</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Env</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>慢速 LFO 扫描产生缓慢的音色运动（适合 Pad）；快速 LFO 扫描产生类似 FM 的频谱震荡（适合 Lead）；包络驱动的单次扫描创造类似真实乐器的起音-衰减频谱变化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扫描方式</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态定位</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>固定音色</td>\n<td>精确音色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>慢 LFO (0.1–1 Hz)</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>有机运动</td>\n<td>Pad/Ambient</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中 LFO (1–5 Hz)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>颤动/闪烁</td>\n<td>Lead/Arp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包络扫描</td>\n<td>单次</td>\n<td>起音变化</td>\n<td>Pluck/Keys</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机/S&amp;H</td>\n<td>不规则</td>\n<td>电子质感</td>\n<td>Glitch/FX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频速率</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>类 FM</td>\n<td>实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>抗混叠是数字波表合成的技术关键。当波表以高音高回放时，高次谐波可能超过 Nyquist 频率产生混叠。现代合成器使用多重采样率波表（每个八度一份预计算版本）或实时带限（BLIT/PolyBLEP）解决此问题。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最高无混叠谐波</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最高无混叠谐波} = \\frac{f_s}{2 \\cdot f_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最高无混叠谐波</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"粒子合成的时间-频率操控\">粒子合成的时间-频率操控</h2><p>粒子合成（Granular Synthesis）将声音分解为大量微小的&quot;颗粒&quot;（Grain），每个颗粒持续 1–100 ms，然后重新组合这些颗粒以创造新的声音。这种方法打破了时间和频率的传统耦合——可以独立控制时间进度（拉伸/压缩）和频率内容（移调）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = \\sum_{i} g_i(t - t_i) \\cdot w(t - t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个颗粒（从源音频中切取或合成生成），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 为窗函数（通常 Hanning 或 Gaussian），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为颗粒的触发时间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>颗粒参数</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>极端值效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Duration (粒长)</td>\n<td>1–100 ms</td>\n<td>时间分辨率</td>\n<td>短=噪声感, 长=平滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Density (密度)</td>\n<td>1–1000 grains/s</td>\n<td>连续性</td>\n<td>低=分离, 高=饱满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Position (读取位置)</td>\n<td>0–1 (源长度)</td>\n<td>时间探索</td>\n<td>随机=纹理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pitch (音高偏移)</td>\n<td>-24 至 +24 半音</td>\n<td>变调</td>\n<td>极端=外星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pan (空间分布)</td>\n<td>随机/固定</td>\n<td>立体声宽度</td>\n<td>随机=弥漫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Window Shape</td>\n<td>Hanning/Gauss/Rect</td>\n<td>颗粒过渡</td>\n<td>矩形=点击声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;源音频/波形&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;切割为颗粒&lt;br/&gt;1-100 ms&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;参数控制&lt;br/&gt;位置/长度/音高&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;加窗&lt;br/&gt;Hanning/Gaussian&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;重叠叠加&lt;br/&gt;密度控制&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;输出&lt;br/&gt;重构声音&quot;]&#10;    G[&quot;随机化&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;    H[&quot;LFO/Env&quot;] --&gt; C\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"源音频/波形\"] --&gt; B[\"切割为颗粒&lt;br/&gt;1-100 ms\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"参数控制&lt;br/&gt;位置/长度/音高\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"加窗&lt;br/&gt;Hanning/Gaussian\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"重叠叠加&lt;br/&gt;密度控制\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"输出&lt;br/&gt;重构声音\"]\n    G[\"随机化\"] --&gt; C\n    H[\"LFO/Env\"] --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"粒子合成的核心应用\">粒子合成的核心应用</h2><p>粒子合成最独特的能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间拉伸</td>\n<td>减慢位置扫描但保持粒长</td>\n<td>Stretch ratio</td>\n<td>任意倍率无变调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变调</td>\n<td>改变颗粒回放速率</td>\n<td>Pitch shift</td>\n<td>独立于时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结（Freeze）</td>\n<td>位置固定不移动</td>\n<td>Position locked</td>\n<td>无限持续音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纹理生成</td>\n<td>随机位置 + 随机音高</td>\n<td>Randomize all</td>\n<td>有机氛围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱融合</td>\n<td>交叉两个源的颗粒</td>\n<td>Dual source</td>\n<td>声音变形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间拉伸的数学——位置扫描速率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>拉伸比</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{拉伸比} = \\frac{v_{original}}{v_{scan}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拉伸比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>原始速度扫描 = 正常回放；扫描速度减半 = 时间拉伸 2x（音高不变）；扫描速度翻倍 = 时间压缩 0.5x。</p>\n<h2 id=\"波表-vs-粒子-vs-减法-选择指南\">波表 vs 粒子 vs 减法：选择指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>减法合成</th>\n<th>波表合成</th>\n<th>FM 合成</th>\n<th>粒子合成</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱控制</td>\n<td>限于滤波</td>\n<td>波表决定</td>\n<td>比率决定</td>\n<td>源决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态频谱</td>\n<td>Env→Filter</td>\n<td>Position 扫描</td>\n<td>Env→Index</td>\n<td>参数变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 开销</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最佳场景</td>\n<td>Bass/Lead 经典</td>\n<td>演化 Pad/现代</td>\n<td>钟/金属/DX</td>\n<td>纹理/拉伸/氛围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱点</td>\n<td>频谱有限</td>\n<td>需好波表</td>\n<td>非直觉</td>\n<td>不适合精确音高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表合成器</td>\n<td>Moog, Juno</td>\n<td>Serum, Vital</td>\n<td>DX7, FM8</td>\n<td>Granulator, Padshop</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>选择合成方法</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>目标音色类型</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>演化需求</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>控制直觉性</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{选择合成方法} = f(\\text{目标音色类型}, \\text{演化需求}, \\text{控制直觉性})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选择合成方法</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标音色类型</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">演化需求</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">控制直觉性</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A{&quot;目标音色?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;经典 Bass/Lead&quot;| B[&quot;减法合成&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;演化 Pad/数字&quot;| C[&quot;波表合成&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;钟声/金属/电钢&quot;| D[&quot;FM 合成&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;纹理/氛围/拉伸&quot;| E[&quot;粒子合成&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;混合需求&quot;| F[&quot;多引擎合成器&lt;br/&gt;如 Vital/Massive X&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A{\"目标音色?\"} --&gt;|\"经典 Bass/Lead\"| B[\"减法合成\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"演化 Pad/数字\"| C[\"波表合成\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"钟声/金属/电钢\"| D[\"FM 合成\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"纹理/氛围/拉伸\"| E[\"粒子合成\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"混合需求\"| F[\"多引擎合成器&lt;br/&gt;如 Vital/Massive X\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>波表合成以多帧波形 + 帧间插值为核心，Position 参数让频谱可以像动画一样演变。</li>\n<li>扫描（LFO/包络/随机驱动 Position）是波表表现力的来源，速度决定它是 Pad 还是类 FM 效果。</li>\n<li>抗混叠决定数字波表的音质，预计算多重采样率波表与实时带限是两类主流解法。</li>\n<li>粒子合成通过颗粒的时长、密度、位置、音高等参数，实现时间拉伸、变调、冻结与纹理生成等独特能力。</li>\n<li>四种合成方法各有优劣，选择应由&quot;目标音色类型 + 演化需求 + 控制直觉性&quot;共同决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"波表合成与粒子合成","id":"波表合成与粒子合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"波表合成的基本原理","id":"波表合成的基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"波表扫描与频谱动画","id":"波表扫描与频谱动画"},{"level":2,"text":"粒子合成的时间-频率操控","id":"粒子合成的时间-频率操控"},{"level":2,"text":"粒子合成的核心应用","id":"粒子合成的核心应用"},{"level":2,"text":"波表 vs 粒子 vs 减法：选择指南","id":"波表-vs-粒子-vs-减法-选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FM 合成与频率调制原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/synthesis-methods/fm-synthesis"},"next":{"title":"振荡器波形生成与抗混叠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/oscillator-waveforms"}}